### Section 4 — Recommended Budget Band

**$1,756,000 – $1,963,000** (85–95% of stress ceiling)

The $1,800,000 target sits comfortably within TDSR limits at current rates, but is the cash constraint — not TDSR — that is the binding issue. The client cannot meet the 25% minimum cash floor of $450,000 from $300,000 in savings alone, before BSD and legal fees.

To proceed without additional cash, the purchase price needs to drop to approximately **$1,200,000** (where 25% cash floor ≈ $300,000).

